                                "example_id": "6eb0aee1-f43c-455f-9cc6-8b565d67f365",
                                "sense_id": "7c27648a-2f0d-369b-8f98-f0dd79957fdf",
                                "text": "gagner le paroli",
                                "translation": "to win the double stake",
                                "english": "to win the double stake"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29f9f688-2836-4213-8a51-aea91f210d1a",
                                "sense_id": "7c27648a-2f0d-369b-8f98-f0dd79957fdf",
                                "text": "Dans un moment de colère contre le banquier, il fit paroli sur paroli, et en vint au point de mettre au tapis une énorme poignée d'or...",
                                "translation": "In a fit of anger against the banker, he made paroli upon paroli, to the point where he had wagered a great handful of gold...",
